<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―After our baths, we went back to the second-floor room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s suggestion, we decided to go over everything once more before bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once tomorrow's thirteenth-year memorial service was over, the police would finally be getting involved. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only we could turn up some useful information before then...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, how many people live in Arata now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Probably fewer than 20... 10 people died in 10 years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">At this rate, the Arata settlement itself is gonna disappear..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the curse-killings kept repeating like this, the Arata settlement would vanish in less than 20 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that the culprit's goal is...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I figured out the culprit's goal! The culprit must want to get rid of the Arata settlement!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No way... What on earth for..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the culprit would know that, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this rate, the Arata settlement will be wiped out for sure.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, in that case, wouldn't it be quicker to just kill everyone off?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, that's true, but... Maybe the culprit wants to kill as few people as possible? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Limiting it to just one person a year is the bare minimum for the culprit, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe they're waiting for everyone to move away..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That's... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">true... It's exactly as you say, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">How do I put it, something about it bugs me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> didn't seem able to <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="もろて">wholeheartedly</STYLE> agree with my idea.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"If that's the case, isn't there an easier way? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">For example, killing off all the settlement's crops, or destroying all the tools they need for hunting... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Or burning down all the houses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That way nobody gets killed, and it doesn't need years, does it? The point is to make the place hard to live in."</STYLE><PG>
But <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>'s argument didn't sit right with me either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The trigger was probably the <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE> incident, but the curse-killing cases started from there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, the culprit must have decided to make it look like <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s curse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, then killing really is what makes sense for the culprit.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why did the culprit try to make it look like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s curse... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Now some people apparently really believe it's a curse, but at first, wouldn't they have thought a living person did the killing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島頭を抱えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm... It's not certain yet that the culprit is trying to make it look like a curse, either..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I know! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, how about asking </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> parents!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got invited because of everything that happened in Megasawa, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Maybe they know something!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, if we tell them something like that, won't they get worried and say 'Come home right away' or something?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come home now? That's impossible this late at night, right? Either way, it'd have to wait till tomorrow..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> was right about this too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, the reason I came here in the first place was―<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay. I'll call them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Good..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Be smart about how you put it, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
It was late, but would they pick up?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hello? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, is that you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surprisingly, he picked up right away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>, who usually had his evening drink by now, sounded remarkably sharp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had he listened when I told him to watch his drinking?<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry for calling so late. There's something I wanted to ask... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others are listening too, so can I switch to speakerphone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Okay. Hang on a sec."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I heard the sound of paper being readied on the other end of the line.<PG>
He was strangely well prepared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if he'd known I was going to call...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, right, I'd said 'there might be danger,' so maybe he was on his guard.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Okay, go ahead."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, so―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I told <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE> everything I knew, and asked whether there was anything I'd missed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had him check that for me.<PG>
I managed to finish my questions while telling him only about what happened in Megasawa, without touching on the curse-killing cases.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE> asked surprisingly few questions.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"It's true that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> was sick and threatened us into killing two children. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The instructions and the weapons and all that were prepared by </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know about the instructions, but the weapons must be the ones <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE> prepared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What among all this had we overlooked...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, this is Goto. Were the instructions and the weapons the only things you were given?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">No, that's not it. We were also given Noh masks and clothes like red robes. So nobody could make out our faces or builds."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was safe to assume those were the same outfits I'd seen <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and the others wearing at the ritual earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since they'd been sent from Arata, that shouldn't be much of a problem.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wait a second, please! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　You were given Noh masks? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　That's really strange, isn't it? If you were wearing something like that and someone saw you, wouldn't it give away that you were from the Arata settlement!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True, this would be almost the same as revealing who you were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, a Noh mask is pretty conspicuous for hiding your face.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I get it... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sent stuff like that on purpose, to stop </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from going through with it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s not that dumb either, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If she got caught dressed like that, it'd make trouble for the Arata settlement..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then isn't sending weapons a contradiction? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　There's no need to wear the Noh masks and robes, either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"No, wait, there's more. Something else came in there with them... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Actually... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">we were given a drug too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"A drug...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah. You inject it with a syringe, and supposedly it lets you move in superhuman ways. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">It takes the brain's limiter off so you can use 100% of your muscle strength, or something..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The 'drugs' <STYLE ID="9">Erika-chan</STYLE> had mentioned.<PG>
If that was the drug, it had probably been made in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But she'd said it disappeared a long time ago...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if a person put out 100% of their strength, what would happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's see... According to one theory, people can only use about 20% of their muscle strength. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In an emergency, that limiter supposedly loosens; that's the so-called strength you only find in an emergency. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then, supposedly, a woman can show enough strength to lift a car. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So far beyond what we saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> do earlier that there's no comparison..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Seriously...? Then you could move without anybody seeing you and pull off crimes like people getting spirited away?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No... I don't think that's possible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If you did that, your bones and muscles would break down in an instant. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">They say that limiter is there to protect the body, too..."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Actually, there were written directions on how to use that drug too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Moving at full power is dangerous, so move only a little, at 80% at most."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were instructions that detailed...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE> really did mean to make <STYLE ID="7">Obasan</STYLE> commit murder―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But from everything <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had told us, she didn't seem like that kind of person at all.<PG>
Beforehand, <STYLE ID="7">Obasan</STYLE> had asked <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE> to help with the murders, and been refused.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet she sent <STYLE ID="7">Obasan</STYLE> the tools for murder? That's far too big a change of heart for <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, if there was a drug like that, there'd be ways to disguise yourself without dressing like the Arata settlement.<PG>
Did <STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE> send them for some other purpose?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the one who prepared the instructions and the drug was―<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\tumbling1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">"What's with you people! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, run, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">, no! They've got the back surrounded too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\竹林黒霧.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Suddenly I heard <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE> screaming.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Get out of there, quick! Get out of Arata right away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what's wrong!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, hey!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
But instead of an answer came the sound of nata and blunt weapons hacking flesh apart and smashing it.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
That was when I heard it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In voices I didn't know...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ちばな">Chibana</STYLE>'s <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="かたき">revenge</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-chan</STYLE>... how dare you...!"<PG>
Everything went white before my eyes, and I couldn't think at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE>, back in Motoki-cho, were... 
{PAUSE ""}
killed...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,アイテム1" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, hang in there! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, go get </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A small figure―<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, it seemed, went out of the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I didn't have the strength left to follow it with my eyes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and... </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "15" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I'm right here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"What!? What's going on!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "350" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
